    "sub_name": "商業資料解析",
    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS ANALYTICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要在教授商業資料解析，廣泛使用商業資料、統計方法與事實基礎的管理來支持和改善決策。教授重點放在應用、概念和結果的解釋上，而不是理論和計算上，因此，學生使用電腦統計軟體進行資料解析。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed as an introduction to Business Analytics, which considers the extensive use of data, statistical methods, and fact-based management to support and improve decision-making.  Emphasis is placed on applications, concepts and interpretation of results, rather than theory and calculations. Thus, students use a computer statistical software package for data analysis.",
